  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Adjust pH to 7.0."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "comment": "Autoclave except NaHCO3, Na2S・9H2O and Na2S2O3・5H2O. After cooling, aseptically add filter--sterilized NaHCO3, Na2S・9H2O and Na2S2O3・5H2O solutions to the medium."
    }
  ]
